# hunting-grounds-borders.vrs: hunting-grounds step 3 setup. Finds the region border nearest the pond (-1880, -1640)
# for the marks hg-in, hg-a, hg-b and hg-far (Build plan step 3): Chaos is moved by `.devtp` every 100 m out to 600 m
# along four lines from the pond, and `.nyar region here` names the region at each point. The points and the replies
# are read from the log ([DEV TP] to … then [CHAT> Chaos] you are …).
# Needs: NyarDevTools (.devtp, .devgo), DevChatEcho; Chaos invulnerable (`ToggleInvulnerable true`, never false).
ensure
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 2
console TPHome
wait 3
chat .devgo pond
expect-log \[DEV TP\] pond
wait 3
console ToggleInvulnerable true
wait 1
chat .nyar region here
expect-reply you are
chat .devtp -1780 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 2
chat .nyar region here
expect-reply you are
chat .devtp -1680 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 2
chat .nyar region here
expect-reply you are
chat .devtp -1580 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 2
chat .nyar region here
expect-reply you are
chat .devtp -1480 -1640
expect-log \[DEV TP\] to
wait 2
